      {"start": 150.56, "end": 150.96, "text": "fungal"},
      {"start": 150.96, "end": 151.76, "text": "drugs."}
    ]},
    {"start": 151.76, "end": 158.72, "text": "We have three good classes, and we found this new bug can develop resistance to all three.", "words": [
