      {"start": 183.136, "end": 184.096, "text": "humans."}
    ]},
    {"start": 184.096, "end": 193.376, "text": "There's another one, there's a really nice article in this edition this month about a fungus called Trichophyton indotiniae.", "words": [
      {"start": 184.096, "end": 184.576, "text": "There's"},
      {"start": 184.576, "end": 184.896, "text": "another"},
      {"start": 184.896, "end": 185.456, "text": "one,"},
      {"start": 185.456, "end": 185.856, "text": "there's"},
      {"start": 185.856, "end": 186.096, "text": "a"},
      {"start": 186.096, "end": 186.336, "text": "really"},
      {"start": 186.336, "end": 186.656, "text": "nice"},
      {"start": 186.656, "end": 187.456, "text": "article"},
      {"start": 187.456, "end": 187.776, "text": "in"},
      {"start": 188.816, "end": 189.136, "text": "this"},
      {"start": 189.136, "end": 189.776, "text": "edition"},
      {"start": 189.776, "end": 189.936, "text": "this"},
      {"start": 189.936, "end": 190.336, "text": "month"},
      {"start": 190.336, "end": 190.576, "text": "about"},
      {"start": 190.576, "end": 190.816, "text": "a"},
      {"start": 190.816, "end": 191.136, "text": "fungus"},
      {"start": 191.136, "end": 191.376, "text": "called"},
      {"start": 191.376, "end": 192.176, "text": "Trichophyton"},
      {"start": 192.256, "end": 193.376, "text": "indotiniae."}
    ]},
    {"start": 193.616, "end": 198.816, "text": "Trichophytin indotiniae is a dermatophyte, and what that means is it's a ringworm.", "words": [
      {"start": 193.616, "end": 194.416, "text": "Trichophytin"},
      {"start": 194.496, "end": 195.456, "text": "indotiniae"},
      {"start": 195.456, "end": 195.536, "text": "is"},
      {"start": 195.536, "end": 195.616, "text": "a"},
      {"start": 195.616, "end": 196.656, "text": "dermatophyte,"},
      {"start": 196.656, "end": 196.816, "text": "and"},
      {"start": 196.816, "end": 196.896, "text": "what"},
      {"start": 196.896, "end": 197.056, "text": "that"},
      {"start": 197.056, "end": 197.456, "text": "means"},
      {"start": 197.456, "end": 197.616, "text": "is"},
      {"start": 197.696, "end": 197.936, "text": "it's"},
      {"start": 197.936, "end": 198.096, "text": "a"},
      {"start": 198.096, "end": 198.816, "text": "ringworm."}
    ]},
    {"start": 198.816, "end": 200.256, "text": "You know, we've heard of ringworm.", "words": [
      {"start": 198.816, "end": 198.896, "text": "You"},
      {"start": 198.896, "end": 199.136, "text": "know,"},
      {"start": 199.136, "end": 199.296, "text": "we've"},
      {"start": 199.296, "end": 199.456, "text": "heard"},
      {"start": 199.456, "end": 199.616, "text": "of"},
      {"start": 199.616, "end": 200.256, "text": "ringworm."}
    ]},
    {"start": 200.256, "end": 204.096, "text": "Everybody, very, very common, especially kids, to get ringworm.", "words": [
      {"start": 200.256, "end": 200.736, "text": "Everybody,"},
      {"start": 200.976, "end": 201.296, "text": "very,"},
      {"start": 201.296, "end": 201.616, "text": "very"},
      {"start": 201.616, "end": 202.256, "text": "common,"},
      {"start": 202.256, "end": 202.736, "text": "especially"},
      {"start": 202.736, "end": 203.216, "text": "kids,"},
      {"start": 203.216, "end": 203.376, "text": "to"},
      {"start": 203.376, "end": 203.536, "text": "get"},
      {"start": 203.536, "end": 204.096, "text": "ringworm."}
    ]},
    {"start": 204.096, "end": 210.336, "text": "And you get a little lesion about the size of a quarter, and you put a cream on it for a couple of weeks, and it goes away.", "words": [
      {"start": 204.096, "end": 204.256, "text": "And"},
