  "captions": [
    {"start": 0.321, "end": 1.681, "lines": ["Penicillium,"]},
    {"start": 1.681, "end": 6.721, "lines": ["one of the first fungus most people","have ever heard of, gave us penicillin."]},
    {"start": 6.721, "end": 8.001, "lines": ["So they have good"]},
    {"start": 8.001, "end": 12.321, "lines": ["roles and they have some bad roles. Sean,","can you tell us about some of the top"]},
    {"start": 12.321, "end": 13.921, "lines": ["fungal disease threats today and"]},
    {"start": 13.921, "end": 17.681, "lines": ["where we're seeing them? If it's more","like healthcare settings or community"]},
    {"start": 17.681, "end": 19.921, "lines": ["or the environment or maybe all three,"]},
    {"start": 19.921, "end": 23.201, "lines": ["yeah, so for the most part,","it's healthcare settings."]},
    {"start": 23.201, "end": 26.161, "lines": ["That's","where we see most fungal infections."]},
    {"start": 26.161, "end": 27.161, "lines": ["And it's."]},
    {"start": 27.52, "end": 30.48, "lines": ["You know,","not necessarily just in hospitals,"]},
    {"start": 30.48, "end": 34.88, "lines": ["it's people who have encounters","with healthcare, in other words,"]},
    {"start": 34.88, "end": 37.48, "lines": ["being treated for something."]},
    {"start": 38.56, "end": 43.92, "lines": ["And probably the most prominent fungal","infection that we see is Candida."]},
    {"start": 43.92, "end": 45.6, "lines": ["And Candida is a yeast."]},
    {"start": 45.6, "end": 48.8, "lines": ["It's very, very similar","to Saccharomyces cervisiae"]},
    {"start": 48.8, "end": 52.88, "lines": ["or baker's yeast,","but it's in us and on us."]},
    {"start": 52.88, "end": 57.12, "lines": ["We walk around with candida","in our gut, sometimes in our skin."]},
    {"start": 57.12, "end": 58.72, "lines": ["But we're seeing right"]},
    {"start": 58.72, "end": 64.56, "lines": ["now the circulation globally","of a brand new species of Candida."]},
    {"start": 64.56, "end": 67.52, "lines": ["Obviously,","it didn't just drop off a comet,"]},
    {"start": 67.52, "end": 72.16, "lines": ["although there is a publication","suggesting that that might be the case."]},
    {"start": 72.16, "end": 73.88, "lines": ["Don't believe it."]},
    {"start": 74.32, "end": 78, "lines": ["But it has only emerged","from wherever it was hiding"]},
    {"start": 78, "end": 81.44, "lines": ["within the last about 30 years or so."]},
    {"start": 81.44, "end": 85.8, "lines": ["And it was seen","in four different places originally."]},
    {"start": 86.384, "end": 89.424, "lines": ["And it has literally","spread across the world."]},
    {"start": 89.424, "end": 93.184, "lines": ["It's not emerging in new places,","it's literally spreading"]},
    {"start": 93.184, "end": 97.104, "lines": ["as patients move from healthcare setting","to healthcare setting."]},
    {"start": 97.104, "end": 101.264, "lines": ["It's carried on their skin","from one hospital to another."]},
    {"start": 101.264, "end": 102.704, "lines": ["The first introductions"]},
    {"start": 102.704, "end": 107.424, "lines": ["in the U.S. were for patients","who had sought healthcare abroad,"]},
    {"start": 107.424, "end": 112.304, "lines": ["had it colonizing on their skin,","and then they came to the US."]},
    {"start": 112.304, "end": 114.824, "lines": ["What makes this one so scary?"]},
    {"start": 115.12, "end": 118.08, "lines": ["Is that it tends to be drug resistant."]},
    {"start": 118.08, "end": 122.4, "lines": ["We only have very few drugs","for treating fungi."]},
    {"start": 122.4, "end": 128.8, "lines": ["And the reason is fungi are so similar","to us that anything that we use"]},
    {"start": 128.8, "end": 134, "lines": ["to target fungi usually has side effects","for us."]},
    {"start": 134, "end": 135.92, "lines": ["So we haven't been able to develop"]},
    {"start": 135.92, "end": 141.04, "lines": ["a whole lot of drugs against fungi","the way we have against bacteria."]},
    {"start": 141.04, "end": 143.6, "lines": ["Bacteria are very different from us."]},
    {"start": 143.6, "end": 145.44, "lines": ["Fungi aren't. They're eukaryotes."]},
    {"start": 145.44, "end": 148.04, "lines": ["They have the same machinery, as I said."]},
    {"start": 148.48, "end": 151.76, "lines": ["And so we've had a hard time","developing new fungal drugs."]},
    {"start": 151.76, "end": 153.6, "lines": ["We have three good classes,"]},
    {"start": 153.6, "end": 158.72, "lines": ["and we found this new bug","can develop resistance to all three."]},
    {"start": 158.72, "end": 160.72, "lines": ["It's really, really scary."]},
    {"start": 160.72, "end": 165.56, "lines": ["This is also the first time we've","ever had a human pathogenic fungus"]},
    {"start": 166.32, "end": 168.176, "lines": ["circle. The globe."]},
    {"start": 168.176, "end": 170.176, "lines": ["We've never had spread like this."]},
    {"start": 170.176, "end": 173.616, "lines": ["And we've seen it in plant pathogens","for sure."]},
    {"start": 173.616, "end": 177.536, "lines": ["You know, the chestnut trees,","a billion chestnut trees"]},
    {"start": 177.536, "end": 181.776, "lines": ["in the U.S. were wiped out by a fungus","that came over from Asia."]},
    {"start": 181.776, "end": 184.096, "lines": ["But we've never seen it in humans."]},
    {"start": 184.096, "end": 187.976, "lines": ["There's another one,","there's a really nice article in…"]},
    {"start": 188.816, "end": 193.616, "lines": ["this edition this month about a fungus","called Trichophyton indotiniae."]},
    {"start": 193.616, "end": 198.816, "lines": ["Trichophytin indotiniae is a dermatophyte,","and what that means is it's a ringworm."]},
    {"start": 198.816, "end": 202.256, "lines": ["You know, we've heard of ringworm.","Everybody, very, very common,"]},
    {"start": 202.256, "end": 204.096, "lines": ["especially kids, to get ringworm."]},
    {"start": 204.096, "end": 208.176, "lines": ["And you get a little lesion about the size","of a quarter, and you put a cream"]},
    {"start": 208.176, "end": 210.524, "lines": ["on it for a couple of weeks,","and it goes away."]}
  ]
}
